# Wrangler / Cloudflare
.wrangler/
.dev.vars

# Environment variables — .env IS committed on purpose: Lovable needs the VITE_*
# values in it at build time to generate previews/published builds. Only
# VITE_-prefixed (public, client-safe) values belong in .env. Real secrets go in
# .env.local (already covered by the *.local rule above) for local dev, and in
# Lovable's Cloud tab -> Secrets for the deployed app — never commit those.

